{
  "name": "agentforge",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "多智能体协作软件开发系统：五角色 + 机械裁判 + 多层锚点防幻觉",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=24.0.0"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node scripts/run-tests.ts",
    "typecheck": "tsc -p tsconfig.json",
    "demo": "node packages/orchestrator/src/cli.ts",
    "demo:e2e": "node packages/orchestrator/src/cli-e2e.ts",
    "verify:p6": "node scripts/verify-real-app.ts",
    "bench": "node scripts/anchor-benchmark.ts",
    "bench:verbose": "node scripts/anchor-benchmark.ts --verbose",
    "console": "node packages/server/src/cli.ts",
    "web:install": "cd apps/web && npm install",
    "web:build": "cd apps/web && npm run build",
    "init": "node packages/orchestrator/src/cli-run.ts init",
    "run": "node packages/orchestrator/src/cli-run.ts",
    "replay": "node packages/orchestrator/src/cli-run.ts --replay"
  },
  "workspaces": [
    "packages/*"
  ],
  "comment": "apps/web 刻意不列入 workspace：控制台需要 React/Vite 工具链，而引擎（packages/*）保持零依赖、node 直接可跑。两者独立安装、互不影响。",
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^24.0.0",
    "typescript": "^5.7.0"
  },
  "comment:devDependencies": "**只有 `npm run typecheck` 需要这两个包**。`npm test`、全部 demo、幻觉靶场、P6 自举验证都**不需要 npm install** —— 引擎是零运行时依赖的，这是它刻意的设计约束。"
}
